{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >DRYFIRE is a no-nonsense tactical shooter, built by a small team who grew up playing the classics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Plan every move or push your aim to the limit\u2014every round counts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Play solo or bring friends; it\u2019s free, no pay-to-win, no lootboxes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Quick rounds, tight maps, and plenty of ways to outsmart the other side.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We\u2019re a small group, building what we want to play. Expect solid gunplay, regular updates, and zero marketing B.S.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3922160?t=1759443057","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3922160/ee7506d6a1ff3cd65166421c49c3802897d08464/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759443057","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3922160/e9342a75dadb9fc282424a6602bdd97218ab83ad/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759443057","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3922160/e9342a75dadb9fc282424a6602bdd97218ab83ad/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759443057","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"In-App Purchases","id":35},{"description":"Stats","id":15}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"This game contains frequent violence, including gunfire, blood effects, and player death animations. No sexual content is present. Some players may find the depiction of realistic firearms and combat disturbing."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >DRYFIRE is a no-nonsense tactical shooter, built by a small team who grew up playing the classics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Plan every move or push your aim to the limit\u2014every round counts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Play solo or bring friends; it\u2019s free, no pay-to-win, no lootboxes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Quick rounds, tight maps, and plenty of ways to outsmart the other side.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We\u2019re a small group, building what we want to play. Expect solid gunplay, regular updates, and zero marketing B.S.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["DryFire"],"genres":[{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3922160/67d65dd3b9a4e7c6483527db1ad9afc29bbcad27/header.jpg?t=1759443057","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3922160/2057985490/f335b2a68490b68a0b8bdc42afb3ebba46a4edde/1759442494/dash_av1.mpd?t=1759443056","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3922160/2057985490/f335b2a68490b68a0b8bdc42afb3ebba46a4edde/1759442494/dash_h264.mpd?t=1759443056","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3922160/2057985490/f335b2a68490b68a0b8bdc42afb3ebba46a4edde/1759442494/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1759443056","id":257211053,"name":"DryFire Teaser 001","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257211053/47550daed9c122edeef1881c59fb424ecce0ef23/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1759443056"}],"name":"DryFire","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> i3 And above<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Minimum 4GB Vram<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 8.0<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 20 GB available space</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publisher